Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamoo! Yamoo! Yamoo! Yamoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is home base to\NPoseidon 3. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Poseidon 3. Proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Our sensors indicate you're\Napproaching a depth of 35,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You are strongly advised to pull back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We may be on the verge of the\Ngreatest discovery man has ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.55,0:01:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We must continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But Professor Hawkins,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,with all due respect, the water\Npressure at that depth is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my life's work, and I've\Ncome too far to turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.91,0:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean waters have barely\Npenetrated this region.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.83,0:01:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Those look like duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Renowned scientist Arthur Hawkins\Nhas uncovered evidence of a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,10,000-year-old lost civilization\Nin the North Atlantic Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.17,0:02:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,These ruins...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What, much?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is this your first time?\NHuh? Ricks? Huh? Weevil?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The bug duelist?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.53,0:02:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle City Tournament's\Nover, you little pinworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be squirming home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be asking you the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So what brings you to town, Dino Brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, the cheese festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're after Yugi's Egyptian\Ngod cards, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just a big fan of cheddar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess you won't mind if I challenge\NYugi for a shot at those god guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat my dust, you termite!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever hear a step in the side?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem shall be yours when I\Nstrip you two fools of your souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the Grim Reaper know\Nyou raided his wardrobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wold valid decou vestrum animus? Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you just got him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise to your feet and duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like Yugi to skip class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.37,0:03:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:03:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't at his locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He left right before Algebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.73,0:04:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't blame him for\Nthat, right? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We never switch places\Nbetween classes like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You did bring the Egyptian\NGod Cards today, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.35,0:04:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you finally figure out what\Nwe're supposed to do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it, but it's as if\Nthe cards were calling out to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,leading me to the museum,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,wherein lies the secret\Nto unlocking my lost
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.69,0:04:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,memories and the powers I once possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, the mysteries of my\Ndays as pharaoh will be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been looking\Neverywhere for you yeah why'd
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you split like that\Ndude there's something i
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,need to do and it could\Nbe dangerous i just didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:05:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,want to put any of you\Nin harm's way but we're a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,team and what affects\None of us affects us all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,i've been giving this\Nfriendship speech for years
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't it sink in yet\Nnow let's do this right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,what are we doing we're\Nbeing there for yuki Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,By doing what exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Great deities of domination,\NI call upon thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the Pharaoh's force to\Npenetrate the dominion of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the beasts and liberate the\Nfury of ten thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be stating the obvious here,\Nbut that looks just like Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It says Tablet of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that Pharaoh is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This part always confuses me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All of your questions will\Nsoon be answered, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We, the gods of Egypt, shall assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give unto us your complete faith, and\Nthe knowledge you seek will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You have served the gods well, Pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yogi, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel as if a dark presence is draining\Nthe power of the Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You could start by dropping those cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.59,0:06:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a horror flick out here. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's dual disc\Nmust have gone haywire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It would take more than\None busted dual disc
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to project monster\Nholograms all over the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be more to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to find out is\Nto go straight to the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's pay a visit to Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.45,0:07:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp, please hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp, please hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a mystical elf on your front lawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm new here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you spell Kareebo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole town's freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Except those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Rex and Weevil?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed,\Nthe city's under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The age of destruction is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, your souls will be offered\Nto the great beast! Oh, souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be in a state\Nof shock or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.81,0:07:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just too weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's even weirder for these\Ntwo weirdos. Let's go. Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The mayor is putting\Nhis finger on the cusp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The mayor is putting\Nhis finger on the cusp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,responsible for all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of this town deserve to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has assured me that\Nhis company is not to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no further comments at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But how much is it going\Nto save these monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba will be holding a\Npress conference later today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But we want answers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This city's in a state of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I need more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an outrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's a total circus over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're not going to see Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In the last 24 hours, monsters\Nhave been spotted across the globe,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,including a winged dragon that\Nwas seen perched atop Taj Mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,These creatures are\Nbelieved to be lifelike
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,holograms associated with a\Npopular game, Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So this monster mess is\Nhappening around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's still no word yet from Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We now take you live to a Kaiba\NCorp press conference where
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,gaming company president Seto\NKaiba will make a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've done extensive testing of\Nour holographic simulation systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can confirm without question that\Nthese sightings are unrelated to Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Our state-of-the-art technology\Nis working perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba claims his company is\Nnot responsible for today's events.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's covering up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else has the equipment to\Nproject monsters around the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, those monsters out there\Naren't holographic projections at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was just thinking\Nthe exact same thing, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the force I felt\Nin the museum somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,triggered the emergence\Nof these creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,which could mean that these\Ndual monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's what Rex and Weevil\Nwere referring to when we saw them today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Age of Destruction is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.81,0:09:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, your souls will be\Noffered to the great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you telling me we're\Nunder attack by actual monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what to think right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this have\Nhappened? Grandpa! Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.93,0:10:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Moto? Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gone, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your strongest cards. The God cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find him! Joey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.89,0:10:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, you might want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.37,0:10:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like he's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Slifer and Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of knucklehead would steal\Nall three Egyptian god cards and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.03,0:10:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,then summon them right in the middle\Nof the city for everyone to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You blokes want those cards back. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:10:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.61,0:11:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is get past us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's only fair to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been known to fight\Ndirty. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's it gonna be, mates?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Egyptian god cards\Ndon't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you, but they\Nserve a new master now, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he know about the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you've got what it takes\Nto win back your god cards, follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegas, those grease monkeys\Nwould lead us to this dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there? Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right above you, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that one of those biker dudes up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.97,0:11:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too far away to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.41,0:11:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you come down\Nhere and face us like a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make this short.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.65,0:12:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess something that you want,\Nthe three Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And you possess something\Nthat I desire, your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on. Those cards\Ndo not belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and they possess a\Npower far more dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.83,0:12:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,than you could ever understand I'd suggest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you hand them over before\Nsomeone gets hurt I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.13,0:12:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,well aware of their ancient powers and if
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you want them back you'll\Nhave to face me in a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,duel all right but just don't say I didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,warn you your soul's mine
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,now let's do you're on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.31,0:12:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start things off with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My Beta, the Magnet Warrior!\NCome forth in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel's in your hands now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So far so good He took the\Nbait The boss is gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thrilled. As soon as the\Npharaoh's life points hit zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,we get his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this freak doesn't\Nuse the god cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,because nothing in the world\Ncan stand up to those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.83,0:13:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it, Pea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason why they\Ncall Yugi the king of games.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy almost never loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my marauding captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And this young man comes\Nwith a very special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He lets me automatically summon another\Nmonster to the field to join him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and I choose Shadow Tamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the worst is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.69,0:13:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This card holds more power\Nthan all three Egyptian gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's as old as time itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seal of Orichalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic infused within\Nthis card existed long
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the sands of ancient\NEgypt were formed, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now experience this power for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.99,0:14:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fate is now sealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seal of Orichalcos\Nprevents us from exiting, and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,all outsiders from entering\Nits sacred boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,When the duel is over, only the\Nvictor may penetrate the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But the loser can never leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,His soul remains locked inside the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.47,0:14:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll soon see that the rules of\Nthe outside world no longer apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.97,0:15:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know I'm no\Nstranger to ancient magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe the power of my Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Orakalkos existed\Nlong before your puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your toy is useless, and\Nyour victory is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but in here the advantage is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For the Seal of Aurakalcos\Nrests on my side of the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,thus granting me unfathomable power and\Nstrengthening every one of my monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.17,0:15:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Seal of Aurakalcos,\Nmy monsters reign supreme!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my marauding captain, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his Magnet Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you've triggered my trap\Ngo soul rope it allows
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:16:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,me to summon a four-star\Nmonster from my deck
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as i'm willing to\Ngive up one thousand of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,my life points in exchange\Nfor this new creature
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing in your deck that can stop\Nme wrong i have gamma the magnet warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.47,0:16:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'll have to do better\Nthan that if you want to defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.11,0:16:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, I'll place one card face down.\NWhy don't you try again, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to do more than try
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.95,0:16:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this card,\NAlpha the Magnet Warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you. You've activated my hidden\Nsoldier's trap. Unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,this card allows me to conjure up a\Ncreature of ultimate darkness Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,a monster that derives its very\Npower from the deepest shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Machyora the Destructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike all my monsters, its strength\Nis enhanced by the Aurachalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I also have a\Nmagic card to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, my shallow grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives us both the power\Nto access any monster we
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,choose from our graveyard and\Nsummon it back to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've chosen Beta.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magnet Warrior. And\Nyou know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can combine my Magnet\NWarriors together Alpha,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Beta, and Gamma
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuse your electromagnetic energies\Ntogether to form Valkyra, the Magna Warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.31,0:17:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your graveyard is empty,\Nyou have no monsters to bring back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.47,0:17:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He better think of something quick, or\Nthe Pharaoh's gonna kick his bum. Relax,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Valon, there's plenty of time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Valkyra, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, man! All right, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That Caped Creep's got nothing on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I must admit I haven't faced a\Nchallenge like this in quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, in the end, you'll meet the\Nsame fate as all of my victims. I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's bluffing, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Magna Warrior's\Ngot 3,500 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,so the only thing that could\Nbeat it is an Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can, and I will, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy you with your\Nown Egyptian god! First,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring my marauding captain\Nback from the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,using the magic of Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Only certain duelists can\Nuse the gods! Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.97,0:18:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to stop me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.31,0:19:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my three monsters! No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.73,0:19:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to summon the Egyptian\Ngod, Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got that thing on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.51,0:19:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the Oracles\Nnow courses through Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,merging the most powerful\Ncreature that ever
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.35,0:19:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,existed with the most\Nincredible force ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trapped in my\Ncircle of doom, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and before long, your soul will\Nbe sealed away for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.73,0:20:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
